  "metaDescription": "Bareskrim Polri has named former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit and five others as suspects in a treason or makar case involving alleged instability.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Indonesian National Police have officially named former Police Chief Listyo Sigit and five others as suspects in a treason or makar case.",
    "The Attorney General's Office has assigned 32 prosecutors to examine the case while the police continue their formal investigation.",
    "Authorities allege the suspects intended to create civil unrest due to concerns over leadership changes and sought to weaken the government."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) Bareskrim division has initiated a formal criminal investigation against former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit and five other individuals. The suspects are accused of involvement in makar, a term referring to acts of treason or attempts to overthrow the established government. According to statements from investigators, the case involves allegations of illegal surveillance and efforts to destabilize the administration before and after the presidential transition. Officials report that the investigation has involved the testimony of at least 71 witnesses and the collection of various evidence pieces. Currently, the Attorney General's Office has deployed 32 prosecutors to oversee the legal file while police continue their inquiry. Authorities have indicated that the alleged motives include personal interests regarding leadership retention and attempts to weaken the presidency of Prabowo Subianto. The suspects face potential severe penalties under local law.",
